# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# REAL BUSINESS DATA — NEVER COMMIT
#
# The sample files used to build and verify the parsers contain genuine purchase
# orders, quantities, costs and invoice values. They stay local to the Codespace.
# Anything committed to git is permanent and public in the history, so these
# patterns are deliberately broad.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.csv

# The conventional place to keep them, ignored wholesale.
/samples/
/sample-data/

# ...but the generated blank template is safe: it holds no data, only headers.
!backend/tests/fixtures/*.xlsx
